{"id":2229,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2229"},"modified":"2025-10-02T17:02:45","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T17:02:45","slug":"single-wall-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/single-wall-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Single Wall Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"50\">Single Wall Cardboard Boxes for Everyday Use<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"397\">Single wall cardboard boxes are widely used for shipping, storage, and packaging needs. They provide a balance of strength and cost-efficiency, making them a common choice for both businesses and individuals. These boxes are designed with a single layer of corrugated board, offering reliable support for lightweight to medium-weight products.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"752\">We at <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"460\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a> supply <strong data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"526\">custom single wall cardboard boxes at wholesale prices<\/strong>. Businesses can order them in bulk to save costs while ensuring consistent packaging standards. With customization options available, these boxes can carry your branding, product details, and labeling in a professional way.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"757\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"808\">Strength and Durability of Single Wall Boxes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"977\">Even with a single corrugated layer, these boxes are sturdy. They can hold items like books, electronics accessories, small appliances, clothing, or office supplies.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1158\">\n<li data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1031\">\n<p data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1031\">The lightweight build makes them easy to handle.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1088\">\n<p data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1088\">Flat delivery ensures convenient storage before use.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1158\">\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1158\">Cost-effectiveness makes them suitable for high-volume shipments.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1361\">For items requiring stronger support, you may compare them with <strong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1326\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/triple-wall-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1324\">Triple Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>, which provide maximum strength.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1366\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1418\">Different Uses of Single Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1513\">These boxes are commonly used in industries ranging from eCommerce to retail and logistics.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1828\">\n<li data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1593\">\n<p data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1593\"><strong data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1538\">Retail Packaging<\/strong> \u2013 ideal for packing clothes, shoes, and accessories.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1662\">\n<p data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1662\"><strong data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1616\">Office Supplies<\/strong> \u2013 storing documents, files, and stationery.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1663\" data-end=\"1752\">\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1752\"><strong data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1690\">Lightweight Shipping<\/strong> \u2013 moving products that don\u2019t require heavy-duty protection.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1753\" data-end=\"1828\">\n<p data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1828\"><strong data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1774\">Household Uses<\/strong> \u2013 storing books, kitchenware, and small appliances.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr data-start=\"1830\" data-end=\"1833\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"1835\" data-end=\"1865\">Options in Size and Shape<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"2013\">Single wall boxes are available in a variety of sizes and structures. Businesses can order standard shipping sizes or request custom dimensions.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2207\">\n<li data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2056\">\n<p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2056\">Small, medium, and large box options.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2057\" data-end=\"2100\">\n<p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2100\">Cube-shaped boxes for balanced packing.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2101\" data-end=\"2160\">\n<p data-start=\"2103\" data-end=\"2160\">Long rectangular boxes for items like posters or tubes.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2161\" data-end=\"2207\">\n<p data-start=\"2163\" data-end=\"2207\">Wide boxes for bulk but lightweight items.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2665\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"2667\" data-end=\"2727\">Broader size and shape choices<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2970\">Medium, large, and cube-sized boxes allow flexibility for different products. Businesses can pick the exact shape needed to reduce empty space inside, lowering shipping costs. Custom die-cuts and printing options further improve usability.<\/p>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\">\n<div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"5017\">\n<thead data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3239\">\n<tr data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3239\">\n<th data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Category<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3045\" data-end=\"3119\" data-col-size=\"md\">Details<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3119\" data-end=\"3155\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Material Options<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3182\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coating Choices<\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3239\" data-col-size=\"md\">Usage Applications<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"5017\">\n<tr data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3684\">\n<td data-start=\"3462\" data-end=\"3490\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Box Type<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3564\" data-col-size=\"md\">Single Wall Cardboard Boxes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3564\" data-end=\"3600\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated Board, Recycled Board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3600\" data-end=\"3627\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3627\" data-end=\"3684\" data-col-size=\"md\">Shipping, storage, packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3906\">\n<td data-start=\"3685\" data-end=\"3713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Available Sizes<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3713\" data-end=\"3786\" data-col-size=\"md\">Small, medium, large, cube, long rectangular<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3786\" data-end=\"3822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom sizing available<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3822\" data-end=\"3849\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soft-touch, lamination<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3849\" data-end=\"3906\" data-col-size=\"md\">eCommerce, logistics, retail<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"4129\">\n<td data-start=\"3907\" data-end=\"3935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strength Level<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3935\" data-end=\"4009\" data-col-size=\"md\">Single corrugated layer suitable for light to medium weight items<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4009\" data-end=\"4045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard corrugated<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4045\" data-end=\"4072\" data-col-size=\"sm\">N\/A<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4129\" data-col-size=\"md\">General packaging, mailing, lightweight shipments<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4351\">\n<td data-start=\"4130\" data-end=\"4158\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Printing Options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4158\" data-end=\"4231\" data-col-size=\"md\">CMYK, PMS, inside &amp; outside printing<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4231\" data-end=\"4267\" data-col-size=\"sm\">10pt to 28pt cardboard thickness<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4267\" data-end=\"4294\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Offset &amp; Digital print<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4294\" data-end=\"4351\" data-col-size=\"md\">Branded packaging, promotional shipments<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4573\">\n<td data-start=\"4352\" data-end=\"4380\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Closure Style<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4380\" data-end=\"4453\" data-col-size=\"md\">Tuck-in flaps, tape-seal, adhesive strip<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4453\" data-end=\"4490\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Standard corrugated closure<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4490\" data-end=\"4517\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Custom finishing options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4517\" data-end=\"4573\" data-col-size=\"md\">Warehouse, courier handling<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4795\">\n<td data-start=\"4574\" data-end=\"4602\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Add-ons<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4675\" data-col-size=\"md\">Divider inserts, die-cut handles, custom cut-outs<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4675\" data-end=\"4711\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cardboard and kraft<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4711\" data-end=\"4738\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Optional coating<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4738\" data-end=\"4795\" data-col-size=\"md\">Easy carrying, organized packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4796\" data-end=\"5017\">\n<td data-start=\"4796\" data-end=\"4824\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Bulk Orders<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4896\" data-col-size=\"md\">From 100 units up to 100,000+<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4896\" data-end=\"4933\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wholesale pricing tiers<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4933\" data-end=\"4960\" data-col-size=\"sm\">MOQ flexibility<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4960\" data-end=\"5017\" data-col-size=\"md\">Suitable for small businesses and large enterprises<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"5019\" data-end=\"5022\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5024\" data-end=\"5076\">Options for further packaging needs<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5441\">For those who want a wider variety of strength-based packaging, you can explore the <strong data-start=\"5162\" data-end=\"5291\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-material-strength\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"5164\" data-end=\"5289\">Cardboard Boxes by Material Strength<\/a><\/strong> category. This allows businesses to compare single wall, double wall, and triple wall options depending on their shipping and storage requirements.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5480\">We offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"5481\" data-end=\"5669\">\n<li data-start=\"5481\" data-end=\"5504\">\n<p data-start=\"5483\" data-end=\"5504\">Free design support<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5505\" data-end=\"5532\">\n<p data-start=\"5507\" data-end=\"5532\">Custom sizes and styles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5533\" data-end=\"5571\">\n<p data-start=\"5535\" data-end=\"5571\">Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV coatings<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5572\" data-end=\"5616\">\n<p data-start=\"5574\" data-end=\"5616\">Bulk discounts and fast turnaround times<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5617\" data-end=\"5669\">\n<p data-start=\"5619\" data-end=\"5669\">High-quality materials with eco-friendly options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"5671\" data-end=\"5780\">Order your <strong data-start=\"5682\" data-end=\"5723\">single wall cardboard boxes wholesale<\/strong> today and get reliable packaging at affordable prices.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes offers wholesale prices on high-quality boxes. We offer various coating options like gloss, matte, and spot UV, and provide free design and shipping. Customize your boxes with different sizes and styles, and enjoy fast turnaround times. Our boxes are made with premium materials and printing options to meet your requirements. Contact us today to customize your order!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2307,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[180],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2229","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-material-strength","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Buy Custom Single Wall Cardboard Boxes, Packaging<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Reliable single wall cardboard boxes for efficient shipping. Protect your products with our durable, cost-effective packaging solutions.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/single-wall-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Buy Custom Single Wall Cardboard Boxes, Packaging\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Reliable single wall cardboard boxes for efficient shipping. Protect your products with our durable, cost-effective packaging solutions.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/single-wall-cardboard-boxes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Shop Cardboard Boxes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-10-02T17:02:45+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/Single-Wall-Cardboard-Boxes-1.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:hei